<title>HONG KONG: Trading in Ultronics shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Ultronics shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of medical and scientific equipment distributor Ultronics International Holdings Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong Stock Exchange said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>The company's shares ended HK$0.055 up at HK$0.455 on Monday on volume of 4.78 million shares worth HK$2.1 million.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
